{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"Kan扩张"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"Kan 扩张"},2]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<p>对于函子 $f\\colon \\mathcal C \\to \\mathcal D$ 以及范畴 $\\mathcal E$, 有拉回函子\n$$\r\nf^*\\colon \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\\to \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E).\r\n$$\n左右 Kan 扩张\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f,\\operatorname{RKE}_f\r\n\\colon \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal C,\\mathcal E)\\to \\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal D,\\mathcal E)\r\n$$\n即是 $f^*$ 的左右伴随.</p>\n<h2>性质</h2>\n<h3>计算式</h3>\n<p>左右 Kan 扩张具有用余极限和极限的具体计算式:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f (F)(d) = \\operatorname{colim}_{f(c) \\to d} F(c),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE}_f (F)(d) = \\operatorname{lim}_{d\\to f(c)} F(c).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>这两条计算式也可以用"},{"Local":{"url":"余端","text":"余端"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"端","text":"端"}},{"Plain":"表述为\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE}_f(F)(d) = \\int_{c\\in \\mathcal C}\\operatorname{Hom}(f(c),d)\\otimes F(c),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE}_f(F)(d) = \\int_{c\\in \\mathcal C}^*[\\operatorname{Hom}(d,f(c)),F(c)].\r\n$$\n其中 $\\otimes,[-,-]$ 分别表示"},{"Local":{"url":"生象","text":"生象"}},{"Plain":"在 $\\mathcal D$ 的对象上的"},{"Local":{"url":"张量积","text":"张量积"}},{"Plain":"与"},{"Local":{"url":"幂","text":"幂"}},{"Plain":".</p>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<h3>极限</h3>\n<p>对于指标范畴 $\\mathcal I$, 沿 $\\mathcal I\\to 1$ 的左右 Kan 扩张 $\\mathsf {Fun}(\\mathcal I,\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathcal C$ 分别为余极限和极限:\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{LKE} (X) = \\operatorname{colim}_{i} X(i),\r\n$$\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{RKE} (X) = \\operatorname{lim}_{i} X(i).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>几何实现 (米田扩张)</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"预层意象","text":"预层范畴"}},{"Plain":"是自由"},{"Local":{"url":"余完备化","text":"余完备化"}},{"Plain":", 换言之, 任意到余完备范畴 $\\mathcal D$ 的函子 $F\\colon \\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ 都可扩张到预层范畴 $\\widehat {\\mathcal C}$, 这正是沿"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":"的左 Kan 扩张.\n该左 Kan 扩张有时记为张量积\n$$\r\nF \\otimes - \\colon \\widehat {\\mathcal C} \\to \\mathsf{Set}.\r\n$$\n这也可理解为"},{"Local":{"url":"代函子","text":"代函子"}},{"Plain":" $1 \\to \\mathcal C$ 与 $\\mathcal C\\to 1$ 的复合.</p>\n<p>例如, $|{-}|\\colon \\Delta\\to\\mathsf {Top}$ 沿"},{"Local":{"url":"米田嵌入","text":"米田嵌入"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathbf{y}\\colon \\Delta\\to\\mathsf {sSet}$ 的左 Kan 扩张 $\\mathsf {sSet}\\to\\mathsf {Top}$ 为单纯集的"},{"Local":{"url":"几何实现","text":"几何实现"}},{"Plain":":\n$$\r\n|X| := \\operatorname{colim}_{\\Delta^n \\to X} |\\Delta^n|,\r\n$$\n其中 $\\Delta^n = \\mathbf{y}([n])$.</p>\n<h3>预层范畴之间的伴随</h3>\n<p>"},{"Local":{"url":"预层范畴之间的伴随","text":"预层范畴之间的伴随"}},{"Plain":"</p>\n"}]}}